1
00:00:00,112 --> 00:00:03,398
What's this clod.md file about? It's an

2
00:00:03,398 --> 00:00:05,609
important file you should create in any

3
00:00:05,722 --> 00:00:08,206
Claude Code project you are working on. And

4
